{"id": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java::19::0", "file": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java", "module": "spring-websocket", "block_start": 19, "start": 20, "end": 20, "indent": "", "lines": ["A handler for WebSocket messages and lifecycle events."]}
{"id": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java::19::1", "file": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java", "module": "spring-websocket", "block_start": 19, "start": 22, "end": 29, "indent": "", "lines": ["<p>Implementations of this interface are encouraged to handle exceptions locally where", "it makes sense or alternatively let the exception bubble up in which case by default", "the exception is logged and the session closed with", "{@link CloseStatus#SERVER_ERROR SERVER_ERROR(1011)}. The exception handling", "strategy is provided by", "{@link org.springframework.web.socket.handler.ExceptionWebSocketHandlerDecorator", "ExceptionWebSocketHandlerDecorator} and it can be customized or replaced by decorating", "the {@link WebSocketHandler} with a different decorator."]}
{"id": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java::37::0", "file": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java", "module": "spring-websocket", "block_start": 37, "start": 38, "end": 39, "indent": "\t", "lines": ["Invoked after WebSocket negotiation has succeeded and the WebSocket connection is", "opened and ready for use."]}
{"id": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java::45::0", "file": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java", "module": "spring-websocket", "block_start": 45, "start": 46, "end": 46, "indent": "\t", "lines": ["Invoked when a new WebSocket message arrives."]}
{"id": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java::52::0", "file": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java", "module": "spring-websocket", "block_start": 52, "start": 53, "end": 53, "indent": "\t", "lines": ["Handle an error from the underlying WebSocket message transport."]}
{"id": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java::59::0", "file": "spring-websocket/src/main/java/org/springframework/web/socket/WebSocketHandler.java", "module": "spring-websocket", "block_start": 59, "start": 60, "end": 63, "indent": "\t", "lines": ["Invoked after the WebSocket connection has been closed by either side, or after a", "transport error has occurred. Although the session may technically still be open,", "depending on the underlying implementation, sending messages at this point is", "discouraged and most likely will not succeed."]}
